            'For the rotator set it up in [[nav.settings]] › [[sw.sec.station]] › [[sw.tab.rotator]] and turn on “[[sat.ctl.rotor]]”: it follows the chosen satellite’s azimuth and elevation and, shortly before the pass, goes where it will rise. In the radar the blue ring is where the rotator points.',
